{
  "id": 492441161,
  "iid": 25245,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Qt: Use stdint uint32_t instead of spx_uint32_t in RtpAudioFile",
  "description": "spx_uint32_t was introduced before Windows, etc. had widespread\nsupport for <stdint.h>. The only reason why rtp_audio_file.h\nincludes the speexdsp header is to get this define. Unlike\nrtp_audio_stream.cpp, it doesn't use any of the SpeexDSP resampling\nfunctions. Just use uint32_t here.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
  "state": "merged",
